    image: "/poi-images/sg-dairy-farm-nature-park-life-v2.webp",
    description: {
      de: "Dieser Park verfügt über Pfade für Wanderer und Biker sowie das Wallace Education Centre, das die lokale Artenvielfalt zeigt.",
      hu: "Ez a park túrázóknak és kerékpárosoknak szóló ösvényekkel, valamint a helyi biodiverzitást bemutató Wallace Oktatási Központtal rendelkezik.",
      ro: "Acest parc are trasee pentru drumeți și bicicliști, precum și Centrul Educațional Wallace, care prezintă biodiversitatea locală.",
      en: "This park features trails for hikers and bikers, and the Wallace Education Centre, which showcases local biodiversity."
    },
    facts: {
      de: ["Der Wallace Trail ist ein 2,2 km langer Fußweg.", "Das Wallace Education Centre befindet sich in einer restaurierten Kuhscheune.", "Bietet Zugang zum Bukit Timah Nature Reserve."],
      hu: ["A Wallace Trail egy 2,2 km hosszú gyalogút.", "A Wallace Oktatási Központ egy felújított tehénistállóban található.", "Hozzáférést biztosít a Bukit Timah Természetvédelmi Területhez."],
      ro: ["Traseul Wallace este o potecă de 2,2 km.", "Centrul Educațional Wallace este găzduit într-un hambar de vaci restaurat.", "Oferă acces la Rezervația Naturală Bukit Timah."],
      en: ["The Wallace Trail is a 2.2km footpath.", "The Wallace Education Centre is housed in a restored cow shed.", "Provides access to Bukit Timah Nature Reserve."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/sg-dairy-farm-nature-park-life-v2.webp",
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Der Dairy Farm Nature Park erstreckt sich ueber 63 Hektar und wurde im Jahr 2009 auf dem Gelaende einer ehemaligen Milchfarm der Firma Cold Storage eroeffnet. In den 1930er Jahren war dies der weltweit erste tropische Betrieb fuer Holstein-Zuchtkuehe. Heute dient der Park als Bildungszentrum und Erholungsraum, wobei das Wallace Education Centre im ehemaligen Melkstand untergebracht ist. Es ist dem Naturforscher Alfred Russel Wallace gewidmet, der in dieser Gegend Insekten sammelte. Ein Highlight ist der Singapore Quarry am suedlichen Ende, der zu einem malerischen See mit reicher Vogelwelt umgewandelt wurde. Wanderwege wie der Wallace Trail fuehren durch dichten Sekundaerwald und bieten Einblicke in die lokale Flora und Fauna. Der Park ist ein wichtiger Teil des oekologischen Netzwerks, das das zentrale Wassereinzugsgebiet mit anderen Waldgebieten verbindet.",
      hu: "A Dairy Farm Nature Park 63 hektaron terul el, es 2009-ben nyilt meg a Cold Storage ceg egykori tejgazdasaganak teruleten. Az 1930-as evekben ez volt a vilag elso tropikus gazdasaga holstein tenyesztehenek szamara. Ma a park oktatasi kozpontkent es pihenohelykent szolgal, a Wallace Education Centre az egykori fejohazban kapott helyet. Az intezmeny Alfred Russel Wallace termeszettudosnak allit emleket, aki ezen a kornyeken gyujtott rovarokat. A park deli vegen talalhato Singapore Quarry egy festoi tavva alakult banya, amely gazdag madarvilagnak ad otthont. A Wallace Trailhez hasonlo turaútvonalak sűrű masodlagos erdon vezetnek keresztul, betekintest nyujtva a helyi floraba es faunaba. A park fontos resze annak az okologiai halozatnak, amely a kozponti vizgyujto teruletet koti ossze mas erdos regiokkal.",
      ro: "Parcul Natural Dairy Farm se intinde pe 63 de hectare si a fost deschis in anul 2009 pe locul unei foste ferme de lactate a companiei Cold Storage. In anii 1930, aceasta a fost prima ferma tropicala din lume pentru vaci de rasa Holstein. Astazi, parcul serveste ca centru educational si spatiu de recreere, Wallace Education Centre fiind gazduit in fostul grajd pentru muls. Acesta este dedicat naturalistului Alfred Russel Wallace, care a colectat insecte in aceasta zona. Un punct de atractie este Singapore Quarry, situat in capatul sudic, transformat intr-un lac pitoresc cu o fauna aviara bogata. Trasee precum Wallace Trail trec prin padure secundara deasa si ofera perspective asupra florei si faunei locale. Parcul este o parte importanta a retelei ecologice care conecteaza zona centrala de colectare a apei cu alte zone impadurite.",
      en: "Dairy Farm Nature Park covers 63 hectares and was officially opened in 2009 on the site of a former dairy farm established by Cold Storage in the 1930s. At its peak, it was the world's first tropical dairy farm for Holstein-Friesian cows, aimed at providing fresh milk to the local expatriate community. Today, the former milking shed has been converted into the Wallace Education Centre, named after British naturalist Alfred Russel Wallace who explored the area in the mid-19th century. The park features the Singapore Quarry at its southern end, which has been transformed into a scenic wetland habitat supporting diverse birdlife and dragonflies. The Wallace Trail provides a rugged hiking experience through secondary forest, showcasing fruit trees and native vegetation. It serves as a crucial ecological link between the Bukit Timah Nature Reserve and the Central Catchment area, promoting wildlife movement and environmental conservation.",
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Eroeffnet am 5. September 2009", "Flaeche von 63 Hektar", "Heimat des Wallace Education Centre", "Beinhaltet den Singapore Quarry See", "Ehemalige Milchfarm aus den 1930ern", "Liegt am Wallace Trail"],
      hu: ["2009. szeptember 5-en nyilt meg", "Osszterulete 63 hektar", "Itt van a Wallace Education Centre", "Magaban foglalja a Singapore Quarry tavat", "Egykori tejgazdasag az 1930-as evekbol", "A Wallace Trail menten fekszik"],
      ro: ["Deschis la 5 septembrie 2009", "Suprafata de 63 de hectare", "Gazduieste Wallace Education Centre", "Include lacul Singapore Quarry", "Fosta ferma de lactate din anii 1930", "Situat pe traseul Wallace Trail"],
      en: ["Opened on September 5, 2009", "Total area of 63 hectares", "Home to the Wallace Education Centre", "Features the Singapore Quarry lake", "Former 1930s tropical dairy farm", "Located along the Wallace Trail"],
    },
